{"id":"9c7e703f871c9421","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md","title":"CW Complex","display":"df-cw-complex — CW Complex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-cw-complex","aliases":["58-df-cw-complex","CW Complex","Cell Complex"],"display":"df-cw-complex — CW Complex","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-cw-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-cw-complex</span><span>CW Complex</span><span>Cell Complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cw-complex — CW Complex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec A,\\vec\\chi\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec A,\\vec\\chi\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X(n)\">\\(\\vec X(n)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-骨架；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)\">\\(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)\\)</span> 仍表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 维第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 个胞腔的附着映射，而不是把原接口改成特征映射接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\chi\">\\(\\vec\\chi\\)</span> 只作为定义内部的特征映射见证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>以下缩写均在本节固定：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\">\\(D_n=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n)\">\\(D_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(n)\">\\(B_n=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n,n)\">\\(\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n,n)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n^\\circ,n)\">\\(\\tau_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n^\\circ,n)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 使用依赖文件中的定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> 是下述定义的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}cell\\text{-}realization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),X^{D_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\tau_n,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright B_n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(n=0\\to\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\varnothing)\n\\land(n&gt;0\\to\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\\vec X(n-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright D_n^\\circ,D_n^\\circ,\\tau_n^\\circ,\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ],\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ])\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle n,a\\rangle\\ne\\langle m,b\\rangle\\to\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ]\\cap\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\vec X(n)=\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(a)[D_m^\\circ]:m\\in n+1\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\right)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}cell\\text{-}realization}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),X^{D_n})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\tau_n,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright B_n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land(n=0\\to\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\varnothing)\n\\land(n&gt;0\\to\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\\vec X(n-1))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright D_n^\\circ,D_n^\\circ,\\tau_n^\\circ,\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ],\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ])\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle n,a\\rangle\\ne\\langle m,b\\rangle\\to\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ]\\cap\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\vec X(n)=\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(a)[D_m^\\circ]:m\\in n+1\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\right)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}finite\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)))\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a),B_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\exists F\\subseteq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle:m\\in n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\n\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]:\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in F\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}finite\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)))\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a),B_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\exists F\\subseteq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle:m\\in n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\n\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]:\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in F\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S(X,\\vec A,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\n\\land\\exists\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S(X,\\vec A,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\n\\land\\exists\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(U\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U\\cap\\vec X(n)\\in\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X(n))\\bigr)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(U\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U\\cap\\vec X(n)\\in\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X(n))\\bigr)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\nU\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\bigl(\\{z\\in D_n:\\vec\\chi(n)(a)(z)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau_n\\bigr)\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\nU\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\bigl(\\{z\\in D_n:\\vec\\chi(n)(a)(z)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau_n\\bigr)\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>第四个参数仍是逐维附着映射族。特征映射只在量词内部出现，胞腔边界的像、骨架及拓扑均使用同一组见证。</li>\n<li>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{-1}\">\\(X^{-1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\">\\(A_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi_\\alpha^n\">\\(\\phi_\\alpha^n\\)</span> 不再作为脱离参数的自由符号出现；零维附着的定义域为空集。</li>\n<li>弱拓扑按所有闭圆盘特征映射的逆像刻画；只要求各骨架的子空间拓扑相容不足以替代这一条件。</li>\n<li>此刻画对应 Hatcher, Algebraic Topology, Appendix A, Proposition A.2。约定与数学条件均已写入前两节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Combinatorial Homotopy I</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}$ 取 [[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec A,\\vec\\chi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec X(n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"D_n=\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"D_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"B_n=\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_n^\\circ=\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(D_n^\\circ,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}cell\\text{-}realization}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\to\\exists U,V\\in\\tau_X\\;(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),X^{D_n})\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\tau_n,X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright B_n\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land(n=0\\to\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)=\\varnothing)\n\\land(n>0\\to\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\\vec X(n-1))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)\\upharpoonright D_n^\\circ,D_n^\\circ,\\tau_n^\\circ,\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ],\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ])\\right)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\forall b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle n,a\\rangle\\ne\\langle m,b\\rangle\\to\n\\vec\\chi(n)(a)[D_n^\\circ]\\cap\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]=\\varnothing\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\n\\vec X(n)=\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(a)[D_m^\\circ]:m\\in n+1\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\right)\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}finite\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n),\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)),\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)))\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a),B_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a)))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a),D_n,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\chi(n)(a)))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\exists F\\subseteq\\{\\langle m,b\\rangle:m\\in n\\land b\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(m))\\}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Finite}(F)\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\Phi(n)(a))\\subseteq\n\\bigcup\\{\\vec\\chi(m)(b)[D_m^\\circ]:\\langle m,b\\rangle\\in F\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closure\\text{-}finite}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ClosureFinite}_S(X,\\vec A,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec A,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec A))\n\\land\\exists\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\vec A(n)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n)))\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}weak\\text{-}topology}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{WeakTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\vec X(n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(U\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(U\\cap\\vec X(n)\\in\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X(n))\\bigr)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cw\\text{-}complex}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec\\chi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CWCellRealization}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\n\\land\\mathrm{CWFiniteBoundary}_S(\\vec\\Phi,\\vec\\chi)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall U\\subseteq X\\;\\left(\nU\\in\\tau_X\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec\\Phi(n))\\;\n\\bigl(\\{z\\in D_n:\\vec\\chi(n)(a)(z)\\in U\\}\\in\\tau_n\\bigr)\\right)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"X^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"A_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi_\\alpha^n","display":false}],"bytes":6323,"backlinks":[{"id":"cf200cb0e17a27da","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S$ (CW-complex predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]])"},{"id":"01ebb1c67b142b36","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"421255505c63a270","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CWComplex}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md]])."},{"id":"6723a6e09cfa1b3f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(X,x_0),(Y,y_0)$ (pointed CW complexes, see [[58-df-cw-complex]])"},{"id":"4b42ccbebbab8162","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-393","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cw-complex.md|58-df-cw-complex]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","ca7fc3ab38a11801","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598","c4b4a825f2ea608d","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}